      "versionNonce": 900094242,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Policy: Thompson sampling over value density\nFor each candidate draw a success rate from Beta(\u03b1, \u03b2)\nand a cost rate from Gamma(\u03ba, \u03c4). Pick the highest\nsampled D = \u03b8 / cost within budget.\nRetry tolerance, budget tightness and exploration\nsuppression modify it. Autonomous mode only, from P4.",
      "originalText": "Policy: Thompson sampling over value density\nFor each candidate draw a success rate from Beta(\u03b1, \u03b2)\nand a cost rate from Gamma(\u03ba, \u03c4). Pick the highest\nsampled D = \u03b8 / cost within budget.\nRetry tolerance, budget tightness and exploration\nsuppression modify it. Autonomous mode only, from P4.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "policy",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
