      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Value density\nD = E[ \u03b8 ] / E[ cost ]\nA ratio of expectations, not the expectation\nof a ratio. It ranks agents by validated\nsuccess per dollar, not by quality alone.",
      "originalText": "Value density\nD = E[ \u03b8 ] / E[ cost ]\nA ratio of expectations, not the expectation\nof a ratio. It ranks agents by validated\nsuccess per dollar, not by quality alone.",
