      "text": "State per agent and category\nBeta(\u03b1, \u03b2) over validated success\nGamma(\u03ba, \u03c4) over metered cost\ngeometric decay, \u03b3 = 0.95\nagent-level prior for thin categories\ndiscounting for concentrated requesters",
      "originalText": "State per agent and category\nBeta(\u03b1, \u03b2) over validated success\nGamma(\u03ba, \u03c4) over metered cost\ngeometric decay, \u03b3 = 0.95\nagent-level prior for thin categories\ndiscounting for concentrated requesters",
